{% comment %}
  Invitation to book a call. Edit the copy here.

  The button follows site.booking_url (set it in _config.yml): with a
  scheduling link it offers the call and email side by side; without one it
  falls back to a single email button, so the block is never a dead end.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="chat-invite">
  <p class="chat-invite__text">
    <b>Let's chat!</b> I am always glad to talk — about research collaboration, or about building something. Starting my own company is where I want
    to end up, so if you are thinking along the same lines, I would like to hear from you.
  </p>
  <div class="chat-invite__actions">
    {% if site.booking_url and site.booking_url != '' %}
      <a class="chat-cta" href="{{ site.booking_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <i class="fa-regular fa-calendar-check" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span>Book a 30-min chat</span>
        <span class="chat-cta__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
      </a>
      <a class="chat-invite__alt" href="mailto:{{ site.data.socials.email }}">or send me an email</a>
    {% else %}
      <a class="chat-cta" href="mailto:{{ site.data.socials.email }}">
        <i class="fa-regular fa-envelope" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span>Email me</span>
        <span class="chat-cta__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
      </a>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</div>
